(1333, '_transient_pa_news', 'a:3:{i:0;a:26:{s:2:\"id\";i:81798;s:4:\"date\";s:19:\"2024-10-23T15:04:06\";s:8:\"date_gmt\";s:19:\"2024-10-23T12:04:06\";s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:34:\"https://premiumaddons.com/?p=81798\";}s:8:\"modified\";s:19:\"2024-10-23T15:04:13\";s:12:\"modified_gmt\";s:19:\"2024-10-23T12:04:13\";s:4:\"slug\";s:45:\"core-improvements-in-premium-addons-elementor\";s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:4:\"type\";s:4:\"post\";s:4:\"link\";s:72:\"https://premiumaddons.com/core-improvements-in-premium-addons-elementor/\";s:5:\"title\";a:1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:67:\"Huge Loading Speed Improvements and Fresh Options in Premium Addons\";}s:7:\"content\";a:2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:14731:\"\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-222972dbe0723a1fe9c6a96f700374fc\" style=\"color:#202020\">Welcome to Premium Addons&#8217; recent release blog post, where we announce new fresh features and enhancements to Premium Addons for Elementor plugin in <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/premium-addons-for-elementor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">version 4.10.49 for Premium Addons Free</a> and <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">version 2.9.24 for Premium Addons PRO,</a> which are filled with improvements meant to streamline your website-building process and enable you to produce beautiful, high-converting pages effortlessly.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-334bae60a2644e3fa568728f1a4c2db9\" style=\"color:#202020\">This release comprises essential changes for better performance and loading speed as well as key updates in <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/elementor-animated-text-widget/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elementor Animated Text widget</a>, including a Page Load/Scroll Trigger option and a No Cache option in <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/elementor-table-widget/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elementor Table widget</a>. Let&#8217;s explore the specifics and see how these changes might improve your website!</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What’s New in Premium Addons for October?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-0542420c8594435ba65c4cbc5a949b07\" style=\"color:#202020\">At Premium Addons, we constantly work to improve performance; this month we have added basic adjustments meant to greatly speed up loading of your website. These tweaks seek to give a speedier and more seamless user experience, therefore enabling you to maximize your Elementor-built pages.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b1c76ac0f7eff9ccb6946de9fd7a96ec\" style=\"color:#202020\">What’s changed?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-451b7c70e0c8fee6e88bd09648e311cc\" style=\"color:#202020\">By making sure plugin assets are loaded just when needed, we have optimized the core of the plugin to reduce the burden on your server. This means rather than loading all assets on every page, elements and widgets will load their scripts and styles only when they are actively used on a page.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-fb5ce08f5950e911c91cf962bc7b4ec9\" style=\"color:#202020\">Why does this matter?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-102b45f4f5b401fa12f50a2d2f421a8b\" style=\"color:#202020\">By reducing the number of server requests, we prevent your server memory from being overwhelmed by handling excessive requests, resulting in faster page load times and a more responsive website. This is particularly beneficial for larger websites and those with high traffic, as it allows for a more efficient use of resources, leading to better performance and a smoother user experience for your visitors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Core improvements to boost your website loading speed</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-033b234b6e9e5eb5ec865a15c38bd7cf\" style=\"text-transform:none\">We have recently made some deep changes in the core of the plugin to minimize the loading on your server and load the plugin assets only when they are needed. By decreasing the number of requests sent to your server, your server memory will not be exhausted handling requests which should boost your site performance.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Page Load/Scroll Trigger Option for Elementor Animated Text Widget</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-72e47e4041e678960be36211f91189b7\" style=\"color:#202020;text-transform:none\">This new capability in <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/elementor-animated-text-widget/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elementor Animated Text widget</a> lets you decide when and how text animations show up on your site by enabling you to start animations on page load or scroll.<span id=\"input-sentence~10\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-882b3a85d9865a8bf1669b0f3f344059\" style=\"color:#202020;text-transform:none\"><strong>Why should it matter?</strong> It gives you the flexibility if you want to make sure your website visitors will always see the beginning of the text animation.<span id=\"input-sentence~10\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Added No Cache Option in Elementor Table Widget</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-17d4add254955b17f248f0060317b69f\" style=\"color:#202020\"><strong>It is what it is:</strong> This change lets you turn off <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/elementor-table-widget/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elementor Table widget</a> caching, therefore guaranteeing real-time updates when showing dynamic material.<span id=\"input-sentence~11\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-295aa6bb3990783d0803199d9d9e0d36\" style=\"color:#202020\"><strong>Why should it matter?</strong> Perfect for websites depending on regularly updated data, this solution guarantees that your tables always show the most recent data without requiring manual clearance of cache.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Correctives and Enhancements</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-671a3afdc7702e7412837b6d89e9e229\" style=\"color:#202020\"><strong>Resolved PHP Warning in TikTok Feed Widget:</strong> fixed a PHP alert for some users using <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/elementor-tiktok-feed-widget/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elementor TikTok Feed widget</a> running into some warnings. This upgrade guarantees perfect integration of TikTok feeds free from backend problems.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-f6ee4619941c9fa963cc470ccf24d6b0\" style=\"color:#202020\"><strong>Blog Widget Compatibility Update:</strong> Solved problems with <a href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/blog-widget-for-elementor-page-builder/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Elementor Blog widget</a> not working following version 4.10.57. You can now enjoy stable and better performance from flawless blog displays.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-709de404f0d6b641b59582ebac748051\" style=\"color:#202020\"><strong>Improved template insertion tailored for Elementor Flexbox Container users:</strong> Fixed a fundamental problem whereby Elementor Flexbox Container feature was disabled and templates were not being inserted. This update shows a notification message if you are trying to insert a template that is built using Flexbox containers.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">At Last!</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2a991d048479160d436d34550f0e3c74\" style=\"color:#202020\">Premium Addons keeps on giving you strong tools to improve your Elementor website with these improvements. There is something here for everyone wishing to create more interesting and responsive webpages, whether it is the new animation triggers or the real-time updates in Elementor Table widget.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/premium-addons-for-elementor/\" style=\"border-radius:0px;background-color:#222c75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Free Download</strong></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://premiumaddons.com/pro/\" style=\"border-radius:0px;background-color:#e88000\"><strong>Get PA PRO</strong></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Come &amp; Join The Community!</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#202020\">Share your thoughts, opinions, and suggestions with us, we listen to you! Join our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/PremiumAddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Facebook group</strong></a> and be part of the community. You are more than welcome.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#ededed\">\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-social-links-is-layout-03627597 wp-block-social-links-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-facebook  wp-block-social-link\"><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/PremiumAddons\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12c0 5 3.7 9.1 8.4 9.9v-7H7.9V12h2.5V9.8c0-2.5 1.5-3.9 3.8-3.9 1.1 0 2.2.2 2.2.2v2.5h-1.3c-1.2 0-1.6.8-1.6 1.6V12h2.8l-.4 2.9h-2.3v7C18.3 21.1 22 17 22 12c0-5.5-4.5-10-10-10z\"></path></svg><span class=\"wp-block-social-link-label screen-reader-text\">Facebook</span></a></li>\n\n<li class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-youtube  wp-block-social-link\"><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXcJ9BeO2sKKHor7Q9VglTQ\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M21.8,8.001c0,0-0.195-1.378-0.795-1.985c-0.76-0.797-1.613-0.801-2.004-0.847c-2.799-0.202-6.997-0.202-6.997-0.202 h-0.009c0,0-4.198,0-6.997,0.202C4.608,5.216,3.756,5.22,2.995,6.016C2.395,6.623,2.2,8.001,2.2,8.001S2,9.62,2,11.238v1.517 c0,1.618,0.2,3.237,0.2,3.237s0.195,1.378,0.795,1.985c0.761,0.797,1.76,0.771,2.205,0.855c1.6,0.153,6.8,0.201,6.8,0.201 s4.203-0.006,7.001-0.209c0.391-0.047,1.243-0.051,2.004-0.847c0.6-0.607,0.795-1.985,0.795-1.985s0.2-1.618,0.2-3.237